  "justification": "Salience is led by NHS/healthcare, education, crime, and defence/terrorism, indicating a strong pull toward Care/Harm alongside substantial concerns with order and group cohesion (Authority and Loyalty). Distributional and fairness themes (inequality, wages, housing, pensions, economy/taxation) are moderately prominent, while explicitly purity-oriented concerns (morality, drugs, GM foods, environment) are present but secondary.",
